---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<PageLayout title="Shape fills" slug="shape-fills">
  <div class="monologue">
    Unlike blob fills, which enclose the entire gesture, the shapes on this page are determined solely by the gesture's start and end points; the path between them is ignored.
    <div class="jp">ジェスチャー全体を包み込むブロブの塗りとは異なり、このページの形はジェスチャーの始点と終点だけで決まり、その間の軌跡は無視されます。</div>
  </div>

  <section class="demo-section" id="shapes">
    <div class="demo-header">
      <h2>Circle, oval, rectangle</h2>
      <a href={`${base}/demos/endpoint-shapes/index.html`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">open full size ↗</a>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-embed">
      <iframe src={`${base}/demos/endpoint-shapes/index.html?embedded`} title="Circle, oval, rectangle" scrolling="no"></iframe>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Three flat-filled shapes are built from two points. For the circle, the segment runs from the center to the edge; for the oval and rectangle, the endpoints define opposite corners of the bounding box. If the endpoints are too close to form a shape, null is returned. A click without movement therefore draws nothing.</p>
      <div class="jp">2点から作る3種類の単色の図形です。円では、線分が中心と円周上の点を結びます。楕円と長方形では、両端点が外接矩形の対角の頂点を定めます。端点が近すぎて形を作れない場合はnullが返されるため、移動を伴わないクリックでは何も描かれません。</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="demo-section" id="triangles">
    <div class="demo-header">
      <h2>Diamond and triangles</h2>
      <a href={`${base}/demos/endpoint-triangles/index.html`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">open full size ↗</a>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-embed">
      <iframe src={`${base}/demos/endpoint-triangles/index.html?embedded`} title="Diamond and triangles" scrolling="no"></iframe>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>The diamond uses the segment between the endpoints as its long diagonal. The triangles are built on the segment with fixed interior angles (30-60-90 and 45-45-90). The seed determines which angle is assigned to each corner and which side of the segment the apex lies on.</p>
      <div class="jp">ひし形は、両端点を結ぶ線分を長い対角線として使います。三角形は、決まった内角（30-60-90と45-45-90）で線分をもとに作られます。各頂点への角度の割り当てと、頂点を線分のどちら側に置くかは、シードで決まります。</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="demo-section" id="slit-scan">
    <div class="demo-header">
      <h2>Slit-scan shapes</h2>
      <a href={`${base}/demos/slit-scan-shapes/index.html`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">open full size ↗</a>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-embed">
      <iframe src={`${base}/demos/slit-scan-shapes/index.html?embedded`} title="Slit-scan shapes" scrolling="no"></iframe>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>These fills sample the image at the point where it projects onto the line, then blend the result with a flat base color. The samples stretch into bands perpendicular to the line, much like a slit-scan photograph stretches a single slit over time.</p>
      <div class="jp">これらの塗りでは、画像を線上への投影位置でサンプリングし、その結果を単色のベースカラーとブレンドします。サンプルは線に垂直な帯状に引き伸ばされます。スリットスキャン写真で、1本のスリットが時間の経過とともに引き伸ばされるのとよく似ています。</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="demo-section" id="slit-scan-triangles">
    <div class="demo-header">
      <h2>Slit-scan triangles</h2>
      <a href={`${base}/demos/slit-scan-triangles/index.html`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">open full size ↗</a>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-embed">
      <iframe src={`${base}/demos/slit-scan-triangles/index.html?embedded`} title="Slit-scan triangles" scrolling="no"></iframe>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>The diamond and triangles use the same slit-scan fill.</p>
      <div class="jp">ひし形と三角形にも、同じスリットスキャンの塗りを適用します。</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="demo-section" id="try">
    <div class="demo-header">
      <h2>Try drawing</h2>
      <a href={`${base}/demos/try-shape-fills/index.html`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">open full size ↗</a>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-embed" data-w="860" data-h="620" style="width:860px;height:620px">
      <iframe src={`${base}/demos/try-shape-fills/index.html?embedded`} title="Try drawing" scrolling="no" style="width:860px;height:620px"></iframe>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Try drawing freely with the tools on this page.</p>
      <div class="jp">このページのツールで自由に描いてみましょう。</div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
